  <span><strong>The core result:</strong> 91.2% accuracy at $0.001 per puzzle vs 55.1% at $2.66 for an ensemble of seven frontier LLMs that gets to use a perfect verifier. PTRM is 36 points better at 2660× lower cost — and the LLM ensemble isn't even deployable in practice without an oracle.</span>
